{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1519,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49db6582c1f36479d45dc8bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "では…加速ッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6725ac44f271c41ac62edfcdddbc622404c5130f527fd09f6d667a8d777db92e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c470bccebd71ffc0ae41522b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "山とか谷とか関係ありません。\r\n私たちは夢への直線距離を最高速で\r\n踏破するのみ。そうでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f568f09a1bfff1df68fed86f7fa39fbe609bf3eef72943cd934abd43db347bf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b3101cb1a47a954a4594d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a1a75b7403489a6da8ba11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6187171daf0cd83405ed28676a1e5578db71985c3568e13f3c699b7bfbf84546",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cf23cfeeb30ade506643248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私たちの光跡はあの日から始まった\r\n…来た道を振り返ってみて\r\nください。まさに一直線でしょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd29bcd367beda208006f3e2c970ee5123d0973f1635b68699ca7e908afc2d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b381266a7d0447d5db787d6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方が必要です。水上を駆けても\r\n崖を駆けても、観測者がいなければ\r\n意味がない。私のモチベ的にも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87981372f48bb26977543f88d568372d1d8a1eb377cb8fda3b0b31a1625bc38e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76e9107271369e51ee816c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ようやく正月気分ですか。…遅い。\r\n遅すぎる。私なんて12月上旬には\r\n新年に到達していましたよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70fbf3fd24cd22f2a31819b342a1a0a89a7b0f2ee966cfe486d7ad6c3472e3c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692c31e3b7aaac2ceebb76d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコならすでに机に置いて\r\nおきましたよ。気づいた時には\r\n渡し終えている。それが私です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713669c0725ea73adef0d4fc3489715c794cb13c0b27973923d2f10dbe01acaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48bebb73b81be0247dc0c826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私のチョコは調理時間を通常の\r\n100分の1に圧縮した光速チョコ。\r\n味は、食べてみてのお楽しみです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0680289832559a9129ea4add487dded66dbca4c1de93e6355c842b4833bcc5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e981d3ea6c9ebaa56fbbad2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "織姫も彦星も諦めが早いんです。\r\n光速なら会えない距離じゃないし、\r\n2人で走ればより早く会えるのに！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac4d25cc4c50cc50117b25eb9dc1dc8edfd6686bae6995a77b2f6c0033a9d69e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd5043aad3770b4e07a7dd5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私のハロウィンコスプレは“光”\r\nです。…どうやってなりきるか？\r\n1日中最高速で走りまわるんです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "579382710d75c59e0713de602ec5e11a35ca1fa2773700480e399ddade2a0497",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247f0354f9e2a712a8419c19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔はサンタを探して街中を駆け回っ\r\nていました。プレゼントを止まって\r\n待つなど私の流儀に反しますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4843dadfc2a3fbb3d6027ef4806e07e230f76fa8dbf86cbe897667fc25a16334",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c5bcd057625b326706ef3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幼き日、サンタよりもらった振ると\r\nビカビカ光る靴…これで貴方に\r\n最速イルミネーションを贈ります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b83c5a55fc1b232f3102b0b2384afecf9febd2a349e41a3c7e78a3c9393c1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66943e04c69a00c549d268f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速を感じられたな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77149246beb74e8805a52d0362f599de7ba5edd5d43f7026f19ae0cea241ce63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f62f7750a244237375c0d1fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園最速で大掃除を終えたのは\r\n私でしょうね。なにしろ先月には\r\nすでに済ませていましたから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8b5c7ecbba262cac2792dd3364057d620fa4cb6b8ead71fe11a9b2fc2fe9605",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90998d068fb5b0659f7ef840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はい、おめでとー！…ビックリ\r\nしましたか？したでしょうが。\r\n私はおめでとうも最高速なんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7083fbc4a82e32de8358de81dabcc85239a3ec5640f978df6e53ba177befb19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728825476dc9da6fa419c43c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼント、なにがいいですか。\r\nいや、聞くまでもありませんね…。\r\nとっくに買ってしまっているので。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c52bfda88772b06cd5496c88da1d5191920825fe3e94c1da17a035ad996c735f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cba7a8d3f1b100d66b88e81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光速で生きていると、実時間との\r\n差が生じ、誕生日の計りようがない\r\nのです…が！お祝いは受付中です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "455a7edcf5e6d7345d42d2566f8b9331edb9b012ef94d5aab4083522bc69c432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d362b5005ae8a578b94dfeea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日プレゼント？“ニャンコ”！\r\n“ニャンコ”がいいですっ！\r\n“ニャンコ”ならばなんでも…っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1ccb04695459e4d753bcce46bb5dbcb8d5304eadd9331545ce39159d1af707",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72dcc229898efb0ead9a6ee8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方にお知らせがきていましたよ。\r\nさ、即開封しましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93104e4b5b53e89c1ea135d5f9ce1c2a9ba900937aa7b22025824e5e0406f9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9109377e8510fbafe258f9f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントを開けましょう。\r\n“足”の早さ最高速の品かも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe375eedf9d8fc5e4ee6bf90452c6be4ab519de076f668135e5df3b97d908ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34ff5a96e422adca0601fa14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気づいた時にはミッション完了。\r\nフッ、速すぎてしまったか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b5a9f3e9633b6053763aa012e82e3a2ce5f4eb92c7eb298538d6ba779e0e9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e81b9edd88d979ca247aa61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "近々イベントが開催されます。\r\n参加しましょう。なんなら\r\n始まる前に終わらせましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "494408abba6f2ece2598fac1dd371b025344aebbaafba23552d1995abdf05804",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc4cdb1d6ab33ed0e0a1f83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベント開催中です。最速完走記念\r\nパーティーの会場は予約完了。\r\nスピーチ原稿も執筆済で安心です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf97f56296fca834651ff9b68cbf47d90601b2c0d2c0a054df14561332d9a8d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79decc35e9fbf6bf86b4e136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "失速したか…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "939e6cdc3e576e7e1d46b22d6b409a4d748b08600db239e404647f33aad59b2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b93f9b14af0dd880a6f118c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘名鑑のレベルが上がったそう\r\nです。最速で見に行きましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0efdfce6d923ae9a6ebc8477bf01b31b064940f0a289517f44d55c1868c75b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d07783981b9fb47262a7513a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なかなかの速さ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a6c347f4831e3e8263fce927fa1f856d7bfbf86d5b6dc136c9263b0cbd1c27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3aa22f0ec1a1d0213e7bf34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光の壁を抜けたか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c8ea504f08eec0a8a056503fdc8d6cc22a495bbe875899e8c79aec97c20c05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d54dd71cebee1dcbf2e6d09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "失速したか…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "939e6cdc3e576e7e1d46b22d6b409a4d748b08600db239e404647f33aad59b2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce67fa3125ebdcc96db5a637",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なかなかの速さ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a6c347f4831e3e8263fce927fa1f856d7bfbf86d5b6dc136c9263b0cbd1c27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e32eade9bc9c6af4ea30fb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速でぶち抜いたぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c57806a6b6f08583c68d28a5963911ee1e485e97f5d780a50d5908c816dddcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5d9e80aed220977524c2be5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞ、光速チーム！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c955ae95e6e2086698d4cc336236c5d6ac0f72121160ae0d496d3ac278b8148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff32d11f9cd4e59761878ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce1f6d6f61a08d0e1577b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速を目指して、\r\n今日もトレーニングあるのみ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0580602ee59ff68a330f19c8f48eadbe289b4969515cdbe2cc82be12710357c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29460843896cd8d7f813fe5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園の歴史は長いが…\r\nフッ、光の速読術で\r\n一気に読破してみせる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "820136521dcb1acd3ba2cd280d2fb2bcbc3a3c5d9dd14f2e9f76cde8e4f555d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5865248c96dac6856b6a5292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースですか？\r\n今日も最高速を\r\n更新していきましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85b86f989212007577346e74964b1bc7a1acf7a964fd60bcaf7528ef85636fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ab80a2d2fa0f021d8c15d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ec94c5c72cc7fe8451771a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この光は…\r\n負けてたまるかっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a52c026d67433877b519603c6c542fb8e5c8944907f1f4ad524f9e2b85ac600b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db173c1e056b489059787ce0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速へ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3013dca86d81a72837206f7803a617f6ddf6ffc109dc58b9970e8314eca2d8d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5cc6313533ea89c93232b18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速でいく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf00ed6fef3144ad4935d9c59ddd6df1f47c8a7dc4e25d0ba5b6ed955652aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61f60f9b5748015a56fbfd7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日のログインボーナスは\r\nこちらです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1750f99ce5e11edad2e11b11c022f44281faa43563f05538560f4ab69a26f77a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54d1ec21682792f59bd466dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さぁ、取りまくりです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c1a7fd7f75f777487f0d665829e5b1303c3b423bf4d34d2842c61d58204181",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05064c92fb6ba5a983b6206d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "きたきたっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f848205bf9aca04d64b9835013ddb03c62b42ba392cba47179073512b942803e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:228607eee5b3867e2ca8a238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くっ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bca6da8ecb6aaeab02e5a22863fa5110f97d666065235a519e4697647e7f875",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
